@mthuret 

I was able to get something working using `createConnector` and literally just copying the source of MultiRange and modifying the logic in `itemHasRefinement` to match that which we needed, which was to use the facet values rather that using the min and max of stats.

Not sure if this is something that you guys would like to solve to work with MultiRange or not. If not you can close this.
